wasapi-loopback
================

This crate is a clean-room re-expression, in Rust via the `windows` crate and
napi-rs, of the WASAPI process-loopback initialization path demonstrated by the
public Microsoft "ApplicationLoopback" sample:

    https://github.com/microsoft/Windows-classic-samples/tree/main/Samples/ApplicationLoopback

It was authored SOLELY from that public Microsoft MIT-licensed sample and the
public Microsoft `windows` crate / Win32 documentation. No proprietary or
third-party application code or symbol layout was used as a basis.

